of the Act [subsecs. (b) and (d) of this section] of transmitting to the Comptroller General of the United States and to the Office of the Federal Register copies of special messages transmitted pursuant to section 1012 or 1013 (2 U.S.C. 683 and 684) of the Act; and (2) the function conferred upon the President by section 1014(e) of the Act (2 U.S.C. 685","path":"jobs/current-law/output/USC_EO_NOTES.jsonl","sha256":"ac1e287b6b606b8adc5c1975f662aae2d31989c1d072e32c89dbc38f6efe8016","source":{"line":3,"path":"jobs/current-law/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"5b6e5de61be4ea9c9c4749827c02d0c9d484107505b7e9adae3172a42351c188"}},{"first_1500_characters":"Instrument: EO:10196\nSource: https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1950-12-22/pdf/FR-1950-12-22.pdf\nSHA-256 of the downloaded file: 1b26d289e1cc0973dfd73566c1000b552c20f41e8c44ab62c82c2263fbc6d2cc\nLocation: 15 FR 9177, PDF pages 1-4 (confidence high)\nMachine-extracted text layer of the official PDF (OCR for 1936-1994 scans). May contain recognition errors and parts of neighbouring documents on the same pages. Not an authenticated transcription: check the PDF pages.\n\n=== PDF page 1 of 40 ===\nV\n^ o N a m *\n'  ^UTTER aT\nSCRIPTA I . X V\nMANET I\nVOLUME 15 NUMBER 248\nWashington, Friday, December 22, 1950\nTITLE 3— THE PRESIDENT\nEXECUTIVE ORDER 10195\nDesignation of K orea and W aters A d­\njacent T hereto as a C ombat Zone for \nthe P urposes of S ection 22 (b) (13)  \nof the I nternal R evenue C ode\n^Pursuant to the authority vested in  \nme by section 22 (b) (13) of the Inter­\nnal Revenue Code, as amended by sec­\ntion 202 (a) of the Revenue Act of 1950,  \napproved September 23, 1950 (Public  \nLaw 814, 81st Congress), there is hereby  \ndesignated, for the purposes of para­\ngraph (13) of section 22 (b) of the In­\nternal Rvanue Code, as an area in which  \narmed forces of the United States have  \nengaged in combat:\nKorea, including the waters adjacent  \nthereto within the following-described lim­\nits: From a point at Lat. 39° 30' N, Long.  \n122° 45' E southward to Lat. 33° N, Long.  \n122°45' E; thence eastward to Lat. 33° N,  \nLong. 127° 55' E; thence northeastward to  \nLat. 37°05' N, Lon","path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/texts/EO_10196.txt","sha256":"d7f39eb38604e156f0d5d60bbfe3e44873e9b590063384705c9d972ad15924d7","source":{"line":630,"path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"54938700bd13f2fbecbf56a633e230c351bf249bc121cc50892f6e70196068e0"}}]}
